## Usage Pattern

### In CalculationEngine
```typescript
// Apply layout-specific rules after database rules
if (layoutName) {
  AutoCalculationRules.applyLayoutSpecificRules(layoutName, calculatedFields, measurements);
}
```

### In Components
```typescript
// Single call handles both database and layout-specific rules
const calculatedValues = calculateAutoFields(
  autoCalculationRules, 
  newMeasurements, 
  currentShape.layout.name
);
```

