## Field Name Compatibility

### Automatic Conversion
- **Input**: Accepts both `widthA` and `width_a`
- **Output**: Sets both formats for maximum compatibility
- **Database Integration**: Works with both naming conventions

### Implementation
```typescript
// Convert camelCase to snake_case
const snakeCaseField = fieldName.replace(/[A-Z]/g, letter => `_${letter.toLowerCase()}`);

// Get value from either format
return measurements[fieldName] || measurements[snakeCaseField];

// Set both formats
calculatedFields[fieldName] = value;
calculatedFields[snakeCaseField] = value;
```

